-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"א/2, 28 October 2020: הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד מיום 15.10.2020,
-- עובדי הוראה במכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה בתקופת חירום (נגיף קורונה)
-- The special collective agreement for teaching employees at teacher-training
-- colleges during the coronavirus emergency, as the circular quotes it: whom
-- it covers, its period, the academic duties and deferred duties, pay
-- unchanged and nothing extra for deferred duties, reporting, and deduction.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in this file is counted in DAYS from the day school year תשפ"א
-- begins at the institution (day 0); when the agreement period ends — the
-- start of the academic year תשפ"ב at that institution — is an input.

§ `חוזר תשפ"א/2 הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד — מכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה, קורונה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (28.10.2020), reference number, addressee (the owners of teacher-training colleges), greeting and subject line; the closing lines report that the agreement was signed on 15.10.2020 between the State and the Teachers' Union.

@desc The parties of the agreement as the circular quotes it. common.l4's Party has no college or labour-relations commissioner, so the file declares its own.
DECLARE `college party` IS ONE OF
    `the teaching employee at the college`
    `the college`
    `the director`
    `the labour-relations commissioner`

DECLARE `agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `send the signed accession letter to the labour-relations commissioner`
    `send a copy of the accession letter to the Ministry's college staffing officer`
    `perform the academic duties`
    `come and teach on campus`
    `complete the deferred duties`
    `report a duty prevented` HAS `duty prevented` IS A STRING
    `reduce or set off the consideration` HAS `amount reduced` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 תחולת ההסכם`

@desc A teaching employee at a teacher-training college, as far as the agreement asks about it.
DECLARE `college teaching employee` HAS
    `employed at a teacher-training college`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `graded in the teaching-employees grading`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `salary under the teaching employees' agreements` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in the civil service`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the college signed the accession letter`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc the college signed the accession letter in the wording of annex A to the agreement
    `salary for the work actually done`             IS A NUMBER  @desc the salary the agreements and arrangements would pay for the employee's actual work in תשפ"א, in shekels; an input
    `reporting-dependent components`                IS A NUMBER  @desc the part of that salary that depends on reporting (travel allowance among them), in shekels
    `share of the duties fulfilled`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of the academic duties the employee fulfilled (1 = all), for the proportional reduction of section 5

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1__para_a akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_b/p2
GIVEN e IS A `college teaching employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to` e IF
        e's `employed at a teacher-training college`
    AND e's `graded in the teaching-employees grading`
    AND e's `salary under the teaching employees' agreements`
    AND (    e's `employed in the civil service`
         OR  e's `the college signed the accession letter`)

-- 1ב ¶3-¶4: the signed letter goes to the labour-relations commissioner at
-- the Ministry of Labour and Welfare, with a copy to the Ministry of
-- Education's officer named. The text sets no deadline, so the
-- obligation carries none.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b/p3 akn:art_1__para_b/p4
GIVEN `the agreement period in days` IS A NUMBER @desc days from the start of school year 2020-21 at the institution to the start of academic year 2021-22 there
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `agreement action`
DECIDE `sending the accession letter` `the agreement period in days` IS
    (PARTY `the college`
     MUST  `send the signed accession letter to the labour-relations commissioner`
     LEST  BREACH BY `the college` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/2 1b: the signed accession letter is sent to the labour-relations commissioner")
    RAND
    (PARTY `the college`
     MUST  `send a copy of the accession letter to the Ministry's college staffing officer`
     LEST  BREACH BY `the college` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/2 1b: a copy of the accession letter is sent to the Ministry of Education")

§§ `2 תקופת ההסכם ותוקפו`

@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN `day` IS A NUMBER @desc days from the start of school year 2020-21 at the institution
      `the agreement period in days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the agreement period` `day` `the agreement period in days` IF
        `day` AT LEAST 0
    AND `day` LESS THAN `the agreement period in days`

-- ¶2-¶3: "שנת הלימודים תשפ"א" is semesters A, B and summer of the academic
-- year 2020-21; the employees go on performing every academic duty of the
-- year, as the institution decides.
@ref akn:art_2/p2 akn:art_2/p3
DECLARE `semester` IS ONE OF `semester A`, `semester B`, `summer semester`

`the school year תשפ"א in the agreement` MEANS
    LIST `semester A`, `semester B`, `summer semester`

GIVEN `the agreement period in days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `agreement action`
DECIDE `performing the academic duties` `the agreement period in days` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college`
    MUST  `perform the academic duties`
    WITHIN `the agreement period in days`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee at the college` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/2 2: the employees go on performing all academic duties of 2020-21"

-- ¶4: the institution may hold part of the studies face to face; on three
-- days' notice the lecturer must come and teach on campus, subject to the
-- Purple Badge rules and the Ministry of Health's updates (an input).
@ref akn:art_2/p4
`notice for teaching on campus in days` MEANS 3

GIVEN `the health rules allow it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether the Purple Badge rules and the Ministry of Health's updates in force allow the face-to-face teaching
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `agreement action`
DECIDE `teaching on campus on notice` `the health rules allow it` IS
    IF `the health rules allow it`
    THEN PARTY `the teaching employee at the college`
         MUST  `come and teach on campus`
         WITHIN `notice for teaching on campus in days`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee at the college` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/2 2: on three days' notice the lecturer comes and teaches on campus"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- ¶5: duties that could not be done in the year are completed in full by
-- the end of the agreement period, whatever the institution's vacation
-- arrangements, as the institution directs.
@ref akn:art_2/p5
GIVEN `the agreement period in days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `agreement action`
DECIDE `completing the deferred duties` `the agreement period in days` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college`
    MUST  `complete the deferred duties`
    WITHIN `the agreement period in days`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee at the college` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/2 2: deferred academic duties are completed in full by the end of the agreement period"

-- ¶6: the salary for the work actually done is unchanged ("התמורה"); it
-- does not include the reporting-dependent components, which go on under
-- their own rules.
@ref akn:art_2/p6
GIVEN e IS A `college teaching employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the consideration` e IS
    e's `salary for the work actually done` MINUS e's `reporting-dependent components`

§§ `3 תשלום שכר`

-- Nothing beyond the consideration for deferred duties, even when they are
-- done when no studies would be held, or after the school year.
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN `done outside the usual study times` IS A BOOLEAN
      `done after the school year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `additional pay for deferred duties` `done outside the usual study times` `done after the school year` IS
    0

§§ `4 דיווח`

-- The employee reports to the director every academic duty he was
-- prevented, for any reason, from doing in the agreement period. The text
-- sets no deadline for the report.
@ref akn:art_4
GIVEN `the agreement period in days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `agreement action`
DECIDE `reporting prevented duties` `the agreement period in days` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college`
    MUST  `report a duty prevented` `duty`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee at the college` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/2 4: the employee reports to the director every academic duty he was prevented from doing"

§§ `5 ניכוי שכר`

-- An employee the director finds did not meet the conditions of section 3
-- is not owed the full consideration: the institution reduces the
-- consideration in proportion, or sets it off against any sum it owes him,
-- the final settlement included. Where the director has made no such
-- finding, section 5 lays no rule (the consideration itself is section 2's).
-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_02-a): "the conditions of section
-- 3" are the academic and deferred duties section 2 sets, which section 3
-- calls the basic condition of paying the full consideration.
@ref akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN e IS A `college teaching employee`
      `the director determines the conditions were not met` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `agreement action`
DECIDE `reducing the consideration` e `the director determines the conditions were not met` IS
    IF `the director determines the conditions were not met`
    THEN PARTY `the college`
         MAY   `reduce or set off the consideration` `reduction`
               PROVIDED `reduction` AT MOST `the consideration` e MINUS `consideration due` e TRUE
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN e IS A `college teaching employee`
      `the director determines the conditions were not met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the director's determination under section 5
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `consideration due` e `the director determines the conditions were not met` IS
    IF `the director determines the conditions were not met`
    THEN `the consideration` e TIMES e's `share of the duties fulfilled`
    ELSE `the consideration` e

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_02-a: section 5 deducts from an employee who "did not
-- meet the conditions of section 3", but section 3 lays no duty on the
-- employee: it denies extra pay. The duties the employee can fail to meet
-- are section 2's.
DECLARE `employee duty` IS ONE OF
    `go on performing the academic duties`
    `teach on campus on three days' notice`
    `complete the deferred duties by the end of the period`
    `claim no pay beyond the consideration`

`the duties section 2 lays on the employee` MEANS
    LIST `go on performing the academic duties`,
         `teach on campus on three days' notice`,
         `complete the deferred duties by the end of the period`

`the duties section 3 lays on the employee` MEANS
    EMPTY

`section 3 lays no duty on the employee that section 5 can find unmet` MEANS
        null `the duties section 3 lays on the employee`
    AND NOT null `the duties section 2 lays on the employee`
#ASSERT `section 3 lays no duty on the employee that section 5 can find unmet`

-- akn:art_5/p2 The heading of the list of enclosures ("מצ"ב"); no rule.
-- akn:art_5__para_1 Enclosure 1, the text of the agreement of 15.10.2020; it is in neither the source PDF nor the corpus; no rule.
-- akn:art_5__para_2 Enclosure 2, the accession letter (annex A); it is in neither the source PDF nor the corpus; no rule.

-- akn:conclusions The signatures and copies list; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The salary figures are placeholders: the circular leaves
-- the salary to the agreements it does not restate.
`a lecturer at a college that acceded` MEANS
    `college teaching employee` WITH
        `employed at a teacher-training college`          IS TRUE
        `graded in the teaching-employees grading`        IS TRUE
        `salary under the teaching employees' agreements` IS TRUE
        `employed in the civil service`                   IS FALSE
        `the college signed the accession letter`         IS TRUE
        `salary for the work actually done`               IS 10000
        `reporting-dependent components`                  IS 500
        `share of the duties fulfilled`                   IS 0.8

`a lecturer at a college that did not accede` MEANS
    `college teaching employee` WITH
        `employed at a teacher-training college`          IS TRUE
        `graded in the teaching-employees grading`        IS TRUE
        `salary under the teaching employees' agreements` IS TRUE
        `employed in the civil service`                   IS FALSE
        `the college signed the accession letter`         IS FALSE
        `salary for the work actually done`               IS 10000
        `reporting-dependent components`                  IS 0
        `share of the duties fulfilled`                   IS 1

#ASSERT `the agreement applies to` `a lecturer at a college that acceded`
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement applies to` `a lecturer at a college that did not accede`
#ASSERT `the consideration` `a lecturer at a college that acceded` EQUALS 9500
#ASSERT `consideration due` `a lecturer at a college that acceded` TRUE EQUALS 7600
#ASSERT `additional pay for deferred duties` TRUE TRUE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `within the agreement period` 300 330
#ASSERT count `the school year תשפ"א in the agreement` EQUALS 3

#TRACE `teaching on campus on notice` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college` DOES `come and teach on campus` AT 3
#TRACE `teaching on campus on notice` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college` DOES `come and teach on campus` AT 5
#TRACE `completing the deferred duties` 330 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college` DOES `complete the deferred duties` AT 320
#TRACE `sending the accession letter` 330 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the college` DOES `send the signed accession letter to the labour-relations commissioner` AT 10
    PARTY `the college` DOES `send a copy of the accession letter to the Ministry's college staffing officer` AT 10
#TRACE `reducing the consideration` `a lecturer at a college that acceded` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the college` DOES `reduce or set off the consideration` 1000 AT 30
